  "prefLabel": "En 802.02 Damage",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 802.02 \"Damage\" means any impact or exposure that results in the need to repair an underground facility due to the weakening or the partial or complete destruction of the underground facility, including, but not limited to, the protective coating, lateral support, corrosion control, or the housing for the line, device, or underground facility.\n\nSource. #14062, eff 8-21-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en800.html"
